              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cory Hernandez Bukszar"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good basic strawberry salad recipe. I did NOT use the dressing as we had an opened bottle of poppy seed to use up. I added a can of Mandarin oranges, and sesame seeds and a little shredded cheese. Very easy to put together and use up produce.",
